msgid "Thus, we should order them to deposit their wood in the Civic Center along the way. To do so, we will hold Shift while clicking to queue orders: select your soldiers, hold Shift and right-click on the Civic Center to deposit their wood and then hold Shift and right-click on the stone quarry to gather it.\n"
